Communication Diagram
---------------------


                        Customer Email
                              │
                              ▼
                  Email Listener Agent
                              │
               writes: email into EmailState
                              │
                              ▼
               Classification Agent
                 reads: email
                 writes: category
                              │
                              ▼
                  Priority Agent
                 reads: email
                 writes: priority
                              │
                              ▼
                 Sentiment Agent
                 reads: email
                 writes: sentiment
                              │
                              ▼
                   Reader Agent
         reads: email
         writes:
             • summary
             • intent
             • action_items
                              │
                              ▼
                 Knowledge Agent
      reads:
          summary
          intent
      retrieves from Qdrant
      writes:
          knowledge
                              │
                              ▼
                   Policy Agent
      reads:
          knowledge
      writes:
          policy_result
                              │
                              ▼
                 Response Agent
      reads:
          summary
          knowledge
          policy_result
      writes:
          draft_reply
                              │
                              ▼
                  Reviewer Agent
      reads:
          draft_reply
      writes:
          reviewed_reply
                              │
                              ▼
                  Formatter Agent
      reads:
          reviewed_reply
      writes:
          final_email
                              │
                              ▼
                  Approval Agent
      reads:
          final_email
      writes:
          approval_status
                              │
                   ┌──────────┴──────────┐
                   │                     │
             APPROVED               REJECTED
                   │                     │
                   ▼                     ▼
             Email Sender          Human Review
                   │
             writes:
             send_status
                   │
                   ▼
             History Logger
                   │
                   ▼
              Workflow Ends


